  (text "USB-controlled precision power stage for a bench PSU: 0-24 V / 0-3 A CV/CC with uA-resolution current ranging,\nplus a measured 10 A pass-through.  github.com/embedded-pro/e-psu"
    (at 30.48 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d1a0c44d-7c11-4d30-96ba-5f0fa57e4400")
  )
  (text "Power flow:  bench PSU (30 V) -> input protection -> tracking buck (VPRE = VOUT + 1.5 V) -> linear CV/CC stage\n-> force node -> ranging shunts (1 R / 100 R) -> sense node -> mode relay -> back-to-back output switch -> OUT\nPass-through:  bench PSU -> 15 A fuse -> 2 mOhm shunt -> mode relay (NO) -> output switch -> OUT"
    (at 30.48 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e76343b3-d98a-40f6-b228-0454a043755f")
  )
  (text "Ground domains:  GND (main board) | GND_USB (PC side of U702) | VFORCE island (range-drive, floats with the output).\nGenerated schematic: run ERC in KiCad 7+ after opening. U201 footprint (TI RNP0030B) must be imported."
    (at 30.48 210.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f16b51a1-82df-4f42-99dc-b542a11ff875")
  )
